s with 👍 once all reviews finish with no findings.\\n\\n</details>\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-30T00:31:50Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": true,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/BoundaryML/baml/pull/5041#issuecomment-5901689168\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOKc_0J88AAAABX8S0JA\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"github-actions\",\n        \"name\": null,\n        \"id\": null,\n        \"is_bot\": null\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"NONE\",\n      \"body\": \"<!-- perf-benchmarks-pr-notice -->\\n### ⏭️ Performance benchmarks were skipped\\n\\nPerf benchmarks (CodSpeed) are **opt-in** on pull requests — they no longer run on every push. They always run automatically after merge to `canary`/`main`.\\n\\nTo run them on **this** PR, do any of the following, then push a commit (or re-run CI):\\n\\n- Add `RUN_CODSPEED=1` to the PR description, **or**\\n- Include `run-perf` or `/perf` in the PR title or any commit message.\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-30T00:32:19Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/BoundaryML/baml/pull/5041#issuecomment-5901693988\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOKc_0J88AAAABX8S79Q\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"coderabbitai\",\n        \"name\": null,\n        \"id\": null,\n        \"is_bot\": null\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n      \"body\": \"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\\n\\n<a href=\\\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/BoundaryML/baml/pull/5041?cs_source=review_comment\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit